</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/634d9d08-8cde-11f1-99c4-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26211575931129.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/634d9d08-8cde-11f1-99c4-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26211575931129.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">22baa72a-8dad-11f1-b903-3d523249b97a</guid><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 13:36:49 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/634d9d08-8cde-11f1-99c4-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26211575931129.jpg">AP Photo/Antonio Sempere - Antonio Sempere</source><dc:creator>古莉</dc:creator></item><item><category>要闻解说</category><title>路透社调查：中国军方利用美国AI模型提升国防能力，“模型蒸馏”技术成中美争端新爆点</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E8%A6%81%E9%97%BB%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%B4/20260801-%E8%B7%AF%E9%80%8F%E7%A4%BE%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%9B%E6%96%B9%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BDai%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E5%9B%BD%E9%98%B2%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%8C-%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%92%B8%E9%A6%8F-%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%88%90%E4%B8%AD%E7%BE%8E%E4%BA%89%E7%AB%AF%E6%96%B0%E7%88%86%E7%82%B9</link><description>
