</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d1cb021e-8d85-11f1-b57d-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/36d6dac029b6466d8b990d49f701f9e0.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d1cb021e-8d85-11f1-b57d-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/36d6dac029b6466d8b990d49f701f9e0.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d5b583e0-8d85-11f1-8b75-7d92620abd07</guid><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 10:44:44 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>特朗普政府官员据报正商讨接手伦敦中国“超级大使馆”地块</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260801-%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%AE%98%E5%91%98%E6%8D%AE%E6%8A%A5%E6%AD%A3%E5%95%86%E8%AE%A8%E6%8E%A5%E6%89%8B%E4%BC%A6%E6%95%A6%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD-%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%BF%E9%A6%86-%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%97</link><description>
