</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d78e0eaa-8dab-11f1-ba7b-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-14T112431Z-564527557-RC233JAQJDY7-RTRMADP-3-BRITAIN-CHINA-EMBASSY.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d78e0eaa-8dab-11f1-ba7b-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-14T112431Z-564527557-RC233JAQJDY7-RTRMADP-3-BRITAIN-CHINA-EMBASSY.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">178b7f8e-8dab-11f1-8c10-3d523249b97a</guid><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 13:22:44 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d78e0eaa-8dab-11f1-ba7b-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-14T112431Z-564527557-RC233JAQJDY7-RTRMADP-3-BRITAIN-CHINA-EMBASSY.jpg">REUTERS - Isabel Infantes</source><dc:creator>古莉</dc:creator></item><item><category>微言微语</category><title>「中国制造」不再等同于廉价、粗劣的产品 中国鹅肝及「黑黄金」鱼子酱成全球霸主</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E5%BE%AE%E8%A8%80%E5%BE%AE%E8%AF%AD/20260801-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%88%B6%E9%80%A0-%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E7%AD%89%E5%90%8C%E4%BA%8E%E5%BB%89%E4%BB%B7-%E7%B2%97%E5%8A%A3%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%B9%85%E8%82%9D%E5%8F%8A-%E9%BB%91%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91-%E9%B1%BC%E5%AD%90%E9%85%B1%E6%88%90%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E9%9C%B8%E4%B8%BB</link><description>
中国品牌逐渐在高端美食领域占据主导地位，鹅肝、松露及与鱼子酱并列「西方三大珍馐」，这几年默默地在中国起革命。当中国以完整供应链、现代化养殖技术及成本控制能力介入，不单使中国成为全球最大规模的生产基地，还把价格大大拉低，令更多家庭可享受这些美味食材。
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a01a6eea-1d7e-11ea-aed8-005056bf87d6/w:1024/p:16x9/0c99d5c8416bca0f5777490363ea3672dbb20915_0.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a01a6eea-1d7e-11ea-aed8-005056bf87d6/w:1024/p:16x9/0c99d5c8416bca0f5777490363ea3672dbb20915_0.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">4595b224-8dbe-11f1-8ab5-997cdefaec2e</guid><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 15:36:40 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>台北特约记者 陈筱涵</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>中国非洲大布局：摩洛哥停发台湾人签证 台外交部依对等原则反制</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260801-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%9D%9E%E6%B4%B2%E5%A4%A7%E5%B8%83%E5%B1%80-%E6%91%A9%E6%B4%9B%E5%93%A5%E5%81%9C%E5%8F%91%E5%8F%B0%E6%B9%BE%E4%BA%BA%E7%AD%BE%E8%AF%81-%E5%8F%B0%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E9%83%A8%E4%BE%9D%E5%AF%B9%E7%AD%89%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%E5%8F%8D%E5%88%B6</link><description>
