</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2a116de0-8cd8-11f1-b7ff-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP-Eduardo-Verdug.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2a116de0-8cd8-11f1-b7ff-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP-Eduardo-Verdug.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">6c5020e8-8d87-11f1-b5e9-f56c7bb28b0a</guid><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 09:03:17 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2a116de0-8cd8-11f1-b7ff-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP-Eduardo-Verdug.jpg">AP Photo/Eduardo Verdugo - Eduardo Verdugo</source><dc:creator>瑞迪</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>中国强化AI科技监管　危害国家产业安全将“禁止出境”</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260731-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96ai%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E7%9B%91%E7%AE%A1-%E5%8D%B1%E5%AE%B3%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%9A%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%AF%E7%A6%81%E6%AD%A2%E5%87%BA%E5%A2%83</link><description>
